solution:
First we draw $BD$: [asy]
pair pA, pB, pC, pD;
pA = (0, 0);
pB = pA + dir(240);
pC = pA + dir(260);
pD = pA + dir(280);
draw(pA--pB--pC--pA);
draw(pA--pC--pD--pA);
